---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Obedience Corp"
  description="Take back control of your attention. A system where you decide what reaches you, how it's ranked, when it appears, and how much noise is allowed into your day. From Obedience Corp."
>
  <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       Hero — copy from the user's Landing Page Version, verbatim.
       ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-inner">
      <h1 class="hero-h1">
        Take back control<br />of your attention.
      </h1>

      <div class="hero-body">
        <p>
          You care about a lot of things at once. Family, work, health, hobbies, ideas, investments, side projects. Each has its own people, its own history, its own decisions.
        </p>
        <p>
          But most of the information that reaches you about any of them is controlled by other systems. Social feeds, inboxes, apps, algorithms, news cycles, notifications. They decide what gets surfaced, what gets buried, and what steals your time. And none of it arrives organized around what you actually care about.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-ctas">
        <a href="#thesis" class="hero-cta hero-cta-primary">Read more <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        <a href="/work" class="hero-cta">See the work <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       Thesis section — continuation of the narrative, copy from the
       user's Landing Page Version. Honest about shipping status.
       ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="thesis" class="thesis">
    <div class="thesis-inner">
      <p class="mono-label thesis-eyebrow">The Shift</p>

      <article class="thesis-body">
        <p>AI gave us some control back. Now we can ask better questions, generate better outputs, and filter information more directly.</p>
        <p>But we are still losing our time. We shifted from algorithmic feeds to conversations with machines. Instead of controlling our attention, most of us are now spending even more of it managing prompts, chats, tools, and tabs.</p>
        <p>So people still spend hours sorting through noise, hoping to find the few things that actually matter.</p>

        <h2>What if that changed?</h2>
        <p>What if you controlled the filters?</p>
        <p>What if you decided exactly what information deserved your attention, how it was ranked, when it appeared, and how much noise was allowed into your day?</p>
        <p>What if you could define what matters once, let the system run in the background, and only see what is actually worth your attention?</p>

        <h2>What we're building</h2>
        <p>We’re building a modular system for taking control of your inputs, your workflows, and your attention, so the right things reach you at the right time, without the constant drag of irrelevant noise.</p>
        <p>The future is not more software demanding attention. It is software that works in the background, respects user control, and helps people focus on what actually matters.</p>

        <h2>User-owned by design</h2>
        <p>Your data, your context, and your history belong to you. They should be portable by default, easy to inspect, and easy to move. You shouldn’t have to fight to export your own information or rebuild your setup every time a tool changes direction.</p>
        <p>And because your information stays yours, you stay free to use whatever AI models and tools serve you best. New tools should plug into your data, not lock you into someone else’s platform.</p>

        <blockquote>
          <p>The people who control their information flow will outperform the people who let algorithms, apps, and prompts control their day.</p>
        </blockquote>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
       Contact section — form copied verbatim from the previous
       src/pages/contact.astro (which is deleted in Task 8).
       ════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->
  <section id="contact" class="contact">
    <div class="contact-inner">
      <h2 class="contact-h2">Contact</h2>
      <p class="contact-intro">
        Reach out for early access to Obedience, a demo of Festival, investment, or partnership. Tell us what you're after.
      </p>

      <form
        id="contact-form"
        action="https://formspree.io/f/xgopdrej"
        method="POST"
        class="contact-form"
      >
        <input type="text" name="_gotcha" style="display:none" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off" />

        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="name" class="mono-label">Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="name" name="name" required placeholder="Your name" />
        </div>

        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="email" class="mono-label">Email</label>
          <input type="email" id="email" name="email" required placeholder="you@example.com" />
        </div>

        <div class="form-field">
          <label for="message" class="mono-label">Message</label>
          <textarea id="message" name="message" required rows="5" placeholder="Tell us what you're interested in..."></textarea>
        </div>

        <button type="submit" class="submit-btn mono-label">
          Send message <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
        </button>

        <p id="form-status" class="form-status"></p>
      </form>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .hero {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    min-height: 100vh;
    min-height: 100svh;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
  }

  .hero-inner {
    flex: 1;
    width: 100%;
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vh, 5rem) clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 3.5rem);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    column-gap: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 5rem);
    row-gap: clamp(2rem, 4vh, 3rem);
  }

  @media (min-width: 960px) {
    .hero-inner {
      grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.15fr) minmax(0, 1fr);
      align-items: end;
    }
    .hero-h1 { grid-column: 1 / 2; }
    .hero-body { grid-column: 2 / 3; margin: 0; }
    .hero-ctas { grid-column: 1 / -1; }
  }

  .hero-h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(2.25rem, 9vw, 10rem);
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.028em;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    margin: 0;
  }

  .hero-lede {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.5vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.45;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin: 1.5rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .hero-body {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 2rem 0 2.5rem;
  }

  .hero-body p {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: clamp(1.0625rem, 1.15vw, 1.25rem);
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--color-ink-body);
    margin: 0 0 1.25em;
  }

  .hero-body p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .hero-ctas {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 1rem;
  }

  .hero-cta {
    position: relative;
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.65rem;
    padding: 1.15rem 2.25rem;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-ink-primary);
    border-radius: 999px;
    transition: background-color 200ms ease, color 200ms ease,
      transform 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
    will-change: transform;
  }

  .hero-cta > span {
    display: inline-block;
    transition: transform 220ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1);
  }

  .hero-cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-ink-primary);
    color: var(--color-bg-primary);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 10px 24px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);
  }

  .hero-cta:active {
    transform: translateY(0);
  }

  .hero-cta:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-ink-primary);
    outline-offset: 3px;
  }

  /* Secondary "See the work →" — arrow slides right on hover */
  .hero-cta:not(.hero-cta-primary):hover > span {
    transform: translateX(4px);
  }

  .hero-cta-primary {
    background: var(--color-ink-primary);
    color: var(--color-bg-primary);
  }

  .hero-cta-primary:hover {
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  /* Primary "Read more ↓" — arrow nudges down on hover */
  .hero-cta-primary:hover > span {
    transform: translateY(3px);
  }


  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     Thesis section
     ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .thesis {
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
  }

  .thesis-inner {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vh, 7rem) clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .thesis-eyebrow {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .thesis-body {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-ink-body);
    max-width: 64ch;
  }

  .thesis-body > p {
    margin: 0 0 1.5em;
  }

  .thesis-body h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.75vw, 1.375rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.005em;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    margin: 3rem 0 1rem;
  }

  .thesis-body ul {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0 0 1.75em;
  }

  .thesis-body ul li {
    position: relative;
    padding-left: 1.75em;
    margin-bottom: 0.25em;
  }

  .thesis-body ul li::before {
    content: "·";
    position: absolute;
    left: 0.25em;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .thesis-body strong {
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  .thesis-body blockquote {
    margin: 3rem 0 0;
    padding: 2rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.5rem);
    font-style: italic;
    line-height: 1.4;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .thesis-body blockquote p {
    margin: 0;
    max-width: 32ch;
    margin-left: auto;
    margin-right: auto;
  }

  /* ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
     Contact section
     ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
  .contact-inner {
    max-width: 52ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(4rem, 9vh, 7rem) clamp(1.25rem, 3vw, 3.5rem);
  }

  .contact-h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-weight: 400;
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
    line-height: 1.1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    margin: 0 0 1rem;
  }

  .contact-intro {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
    max-width: 48ch;
    margin: 0 0 clamp(2rem, 4vh, 3rem);
  }

  .contact-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.75rem;
  }

  .form-field label {
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .form-field input,
  .form-field textarea {
    width: 100%;
    background: transparent;
    border: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-rule);
    padding: 0.65rem 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 1.0625rem;
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    outline: none;
    transition: border-color 150ms ease;
    resize: none;
  }

  .form-field input::placeholder,
  .form-field textarea::placeholder {
    color: var(--color-ink-muted);
  }

  .form-field input:focus,
  .form-field textarea:focus {
    border-bottom-color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  .submit-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    align-self: flex-start;
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    padding: 0.65rem 0;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-ink-primary);
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: opacity 150ms ease;
  }

  .submit-btn:hover {
    opacity: 0.6;
  }

  .form-status {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    min-height: 1.5em;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .form-status[data-state="ok"] {
    color: var(--color-ink-primary);
  }

  .form-status[data-state="err"] {
    color: #b84a3d;
  }
</style>

<script>
  const form = document.getElementById('contact-form') as HTMLFormElement | null;
  const status = document.getElementById('form-status') as HTMLElement | null;

  form?.addEventListener('submit', async (e) => {
    e.preventDefault();
    const data = new FormData(form);

    try {
      const res = await fetch(form.action, {
        method: 'POST',
        body: data,
        headers: { Accept: 'application/json' },
      });

      if (status) {
        if (res.ok) {
          status.textContent = "Message sent. We'll be in touch.";
          status.dataset.state = 'ok';
          form.reset();
        } else {
          status.textContent = 'Something went wrong. Please try again.';
          status.dataset.state = 'err';
        }
      }
    } catch {
      if (status) {
        status.textContent = 'Network error. Please try again.';
        status.dataset.state = 'err';
      }
    }
  });
</script>
